div.p:
How obscure and treacherous is this document; how it omits the name of Ortega;
                    what an innocent and natural air it bears. If we say to the government, Here,
                    that artful idea, that order, is an ambush from behind which you will
                    assassinate the legitimate possessor of what you declare to be your inheritance;
                    then they might say, What do you deduce from? Damn anathemas on the calumniator.
                    Shame and punishment to the suspicious rogue!
